{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "689787d2-edff-85c5-b559-515bc5b36704",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T13:45:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rafael Herrera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:42:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:42:31-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Rafael Herrera here. Sorry about the noise, I'm at the laundromat, I work the counter here, and the dryers are going like crazy. So I got in this morning, opened up, did the coffee, and then I walked over to check on a place I'm helping with."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:42:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:42:57-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so the landlord there had a tenant move out over the weekend, and he left a whole pile on the curb. A mattress, a busted couch, a couple of chairs, some boxes of stuff. It's been sitting there since Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:43:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Is this a house or an apartment building?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:43:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a house, a two-family. Three thirty-one Ayrault Street, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:43:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three thirty-one Ayrault. Okay. And you're saying the landlord put the furniture out, it wasn't a scheduled bulk pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:43:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't think so. I don't think he called anybody. He just dragged it all out there. Is there a fee for that? Like, for picking up the big stuff?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:43:51-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bulk items usually do need to be set up ahead of time, and there can be a charge depending on what it is. A mattress and a couch are the kind of thing that gets scheduled. I can't quote you the amount from here, but the owner would need to arrange it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:44:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's on him, not on me. I just want to be clear, I'm not the owner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:44:24-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, it'd be the property owner. I can send someone out to look at the curb and note it, and the owner may get contacted. Do you have a name for the landlord?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:44:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't want to give his name, I just work with him sometimes. Can you just log the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:44:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's fine. I'll log the address and what's out there. Mattress, couch, chairs, boxes. Anything blocking the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:44:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Kind of, yeah. The couch is half on the sidewalk. You'd have to step into the street to get around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:45:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll put that in so it gets looked at sooner. Do you want a callback, or are you all set?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:45:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, a callback would be good, in case somebody has questions. It's 401-555-0178."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:45:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one seven eight, got it. Somebody will check the curb and follow up with the owner about getting it scheduled properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:45:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And the fee, that's between the city and him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:45:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:45:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great. Thanks, Denise. I've got a guy waiting on a wash and fold ticket here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:45:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, thanks for calling."
    }
  ],
